---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (Shared across all sale contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: caller invokes releaseVestedTokens(investor)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_none: position.vestingContract == address(0)
    q_revert_none --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_check_vesting --> q_call_release: vestingContract exists
    q_call_release --> q_check_amount: vestingContract.release()
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_zero: releasable amount == 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NothingToRelease
    q_check_amount --> q_transfer: releasable amount > 0
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer tokens from vesting to investor; emit VestedTokensReleased()

    note right of q_call_release
        INV-001: Vesting contract controls release schedule
        INV-002: Anyone can trigger release for any investor (permissionless)
        INV-003: Only releases tokens that are vested per schedule
    end note
